<div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #2450E6">03 · SIGNED DEPLOYS</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: #0F1A2E">Nothing runs unless it’s signed.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: #334055">Each deploy produces a content-addressed version bundle. Desired state reaches hosts as an Ed25519-signed snapshot with a revision number. Components verify before they apply, and fail closed when they can’t.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid #EDEFF3">
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EDEFF3; font-size: 15px; color: #334055"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="#0E8A7A" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7.5"></circle><path d="M5.5 9.2l2.3 2.3 4.7-5"></path></svg>Rollback is re-pointing to an earlier signed version</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EDEFF3; font-size: 15px; color: #334055"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="#B4311F" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7.5"></circle><path d="M6 6l6 6M12 6l-6 6"></path></svg>Replayed or tampered envelopes are rejected</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EDEFF3; font-size: 15px; color: #334055"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="#9A5B00" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M5 7V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2"></path></svg>Older revisions are fenced out, never re-applied</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EDEFF3; font-size: 15px; color: #334055"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="#334055" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M6 8h6M6 11h4"></path></svg>Secrets come from stdin and never live in config</li>
</ul>
</div>

